</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>ZIGGY-OS OPERATIONS MONITOR | ENGINEER: MAX (MrPistolWhippy)</h1>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><h3>LEDGER CAPACITY</h3><div class="metric">$TOTAL_B Blocks</div><p class="desc">A permanent, tamper-proof record book where transactions are cryptographically locked in sequential order.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>THREAT ISOLATION</h3><div class="metric">$ACTIVE_T Signals</div><p class="desc">Real-time tracking filters that monitor tag movement and automatically flag anomalies to isolate risk profiles.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>PEER DISTRIBUTION</h3><div class="metric">$TOTAL_P Peers Active</div><p class="desc">Decentralized network balanced evenly across 5 continental geographic regions to eliminate single points of failure.</p></div>
